@startuml
title YARN 队列容量的设计与回收

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "历史时间片\n每队列 demand / allocated / pending\n任务到达、Container 时长、完成 SLA" as history #E0F2FE
rectangle "峰值重叠分析\n哪些关键工作负载在同一窗口出现" as overlap #DBEAFE
rectangle "保证容量 capacity\n目标等待时间内必须启动的需求" as guaranteed #DCFCE7
rectangle "弹性区间\n空闲时可借用，maximum-capacity 限上界" as elastic #FEF3C7
rectangle "资源回收\n自然结束或 preemption\n观察归还 guaranteed capacity 的耗时" as reclaim #FDE68A
rectangle "验证\n关键作业 SLA、pending、重算成本与利用率" as verify #DCFCE7

history -down-> overlap
overlap -down-> guaranteed
guaranteed -down-> elastic
elastic -down-> reclaim
reclaim -down-> verify
verify .up.> history : 定期重算

note right of history
  Allocated 被配额截断时，
  不能代表真实 Demand
end note

note right of guaranteed
  平均使用率用于成本观察，
  峰值重叠与等待 SLA 决定保证量
end note

note right of reclaim
  capacity 是最终收敛目标；
  不开启抢占时常要等 Container 自然结束
end note
@enduml
